{
  "name": "Docker Container Status Dashboard",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 10
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Schedule Every 10 Min",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [260, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "command": "docker ps -a --format '{{.Names}}|{{.Status}}|{{.Image}}|{{.Ports}}'"
      },
      "name": "SSH Docker PS",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.ssh",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [480, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "sshPassword": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const output = $input.first().json.stdout;\nconst lines = output.trim().split('\\n').filter(l => l.length > 0);\nconst containers = lines.map(line => {\n  const [name, status, image, ports] = line.split('|');\n  return {\n    name: name || '',\n    status: status || '',\n    image: image || '',\n    ports: ports || '',\n    isRunning: (status || '').toLowerCase().includes('up'),\n    timestamp: new Date().toISOString()\n  };\n});\nreturn containers.map(c => ({ json: c }));"
      },
      "name": "Parse Container Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [700, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "values": {
          "string": [
            {
              "name": "criticalContainers",
              "value": "nginx,postgres,redis,app-backend"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Set Critical Containers",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [920, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "condition-stopped",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.isRunning }}",
              "rightValue": false,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "name": "Filter Stopped Containers",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1140, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const item = $input.first().json;\nconst criticals = ($('Set Critical Containers').first().json.criticalContainers || '').split(',');\nconst isCritical = criticals.some(c => item.name.includes(c.trim()));\nreturn [{ json: { ...item, isCritical } }];"
      },
      "name": "Check If Critical",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1360, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "condition-critical",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.isCritical }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "name": "Is Critical Container",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1580, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "",
        "text": "🐳 *CRITICAL: Docker Container Down*\n\nContainer: `{{ $json.name }}`\nImage: {{ $json.image }}\nLast Status: {{ $json.status }}\nTimestamp: {{ $json.timestamp }}\n\n🔴 Critical service is offline!",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown"
        }
      },
      "name": "Telegram Critical Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1800, 100],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "byName",
          "value": "ContainerLog"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "timestamp": "={{ $json.timestamp }}",
            "container_name": "={{ $json.name }}",
            "image": "={{ $json.image }}",
            "status": "={{ $json.status }}",
            "is_running": "={{ $json.isRunning }}",
            "is_critical": "={{ $json.isCritical || false }}"
          }
        }
      },
      "name": "Google Sheets Container Log",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.1,
      "position": [1360, 440],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Docker Container Status Dashboard\n\n**Schedule:** Every 10 minutes\n**Function:** SSHs into server, runs `docker ps -a`, parses container statuses.\n\n**Alerts:** Telegram notification for stopped critical containers.\n**Logging:** All container statuses logged to Google Sheets.\n\n### Setup\n1. Configure SSH credentials for the Docker host\n2. Update critical container names in 'Set Critical Containers'\n3. Configure Telegram Bot credentials and chat ID\n4. Set Google Sheets document ID",
        "width": 400,
        "height": 280
      },
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [220, -60]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Schedule Every 10 Min": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "SSH Docker PS",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "SSH Docker PS": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Parse Container Status",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Parse Container Status": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Set Critical Containers",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Set Critical Containers": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Filter Stopped Containers",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Filter Stopped Containers": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Check If Critical",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Google Sheets Container Log",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Check If Critical": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Is Critical Container",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Is Critical Container": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Telegram Critical Alert",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        []
      ]
    }
  }
}